(   Combining multiple hedging devices in the same clause produces weak, unscholarly prose:) Tj
T*
(   - Flawed: "These data might possibly perhaps indicate a potential binding interaction.") Tj
T*
(   - Revised: "These data suggest that a binding interaction may occur.") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
